  "problem": "Earlier dependency owners can leave other workers blocked while resolving exact writer siblings sequentially.",
  "implementation": "Bounded job-local queue of exact unfinished anchor keys. Ready and footprint-pruned writers retain their original paths. Missing siblings are exposed before resolving them in original source/command order. Single-owner cells allow waiters to help only strictly earlier anchor levels. No feature replay, duplicate builds, added threads, fixed halo or altered reach.",
