    "distinction": "Exact unresolved writer siblings, single owner cells and strictly earlier anchor helpers; no replay, fixed halo expansion, duplicated construction or extra workers.",
    "dependency_order": "Column N = 2*N; anchor N = 2*N+1. Full column N only needs earlier columns and anchors N-1. Partial support prefixes decrease command key; they do not claim a full column N cell and only call earlier column/anchor cells.",
    "wakeup": "Claim state tracks contended cells. Waiters recheck value and abandoned claim while holding queue mutex; publishing or abandoning a contended claim locks the same mutex before notifying. Empty or ineligible queue waits without timeout/polling.",
    "ownership": "Only key descriptors queued. All helpers synchronous, root dispatch joins them. Successful prefixes consume every prepared writer before complete; root clears stale descriptors before Arc::try_unwrap.",
    "bounded_queue_capacity": 4096,
    "fallback": "On duplicate/full queue, original prefix still resolves every writer in source order.",
    "failure": "Original result/error cached; helper errors enter existing Planner.fail. Panic resets ownership and wakes. Joined failure drops all unconsumed descriptors and cells with Planner.",
    "memory": "Extra atomic per ColumnCell may add alignment-sized padding; layout and peak memory must be measured.",
    "initial_compile_failure": "470a388 tests-first.log: panic-only initializer needed explicit fixture Cell<i32>; fixed in ea9d0df without production edits.",
    "not_yet_proven": [
      "Full NBT parity",
      "Concurrent region behavior",
      "Queue cost versus useful helper parallelism",
      "Memory impact",
      "Quiet median/p95 acceptance",
      "Portal/DH lifecycle"
    ]
  },
